iv class=\"stamp\">\n        RECEIVED<br>\n        DEPT. OF JUSTICE<br>\n        CRIMINAL DIVISION<br>\n        95 JUN 29 P12:57<br>\n        INTERNAL SECURITY<br>\n        SECTION\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"header-left\">\n            <div class=\"company-name\">DANIEL J. EDELMAN, INC.</div>\n            1420 K Street, N.W.<br>\n            10th Floor<br>\n            Washington, D.C. 20005<br>\n            Phone 202. 371-0200<br>\n            FAX 202. 371-0490<br>\n            FAX 202. 371-2858<br>\n            Telex 6501454152 MCI\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"header-right\">\n            <div class=\"pr-worldwide\">Public Relations Worldwide</div>\n            <div class=\"edelman-logo\"><span>E</span>DELMA<span>N</span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"date\">April 6, 1995</div>\n\n    <div class=\"recipient\">\n        Mr. Dave Ahearn<br>\n        Economic Correspondent<br>\n        Bloomberg Business News<br>\n        292 National Press Building<br>\n        Washington, DC 20045\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"salutation\">Dear Mr. Ahearn:</div>\n\n    <p>As you know, negotiations are getting underway for Chile to join the North American Free Trade Agreement. President Clinton and the other Nafta nations made the invitation last December.</p>\n\n    <p>Edelman is handling Chile's communications activities in the United States, and I want to let you know that we can be of assistance when you prepare stories on the upcoming negotiations. We can provide you with a broad range of information on Chile such as media kits and interview opportunities with Chilean officials.</p>\n\n    <p>It is important to keep in mind why the Nafta nations selected Chile as their first Latin American partner:</p>\n\n    <div class=\"bullet-list\">\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■</div>\n            <div class=\"bullet-text\">Chile's economy has undergone dramatic reform and is one of the most open and advanced in Latin America;</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■</div>\n            <div class=\"bullet-text\">Chile can serve as a key building block in expanding economic reforms and more open trade throughout the hemisphere;</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\">\n            <div class=\"bullet\">■</div>\n            <div class=\"bullet-text\">Chile is a proven investment partner for the U.S.</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p>Please feel free to contact me if I can be of any assistance. My phone number is 202-371-0200.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"closing\">Sincerely,</div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder signature-placeholder\">[Signature: Jeffrey M. Surrell]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"sender-name\">Jeffrey M. Surrell</div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer-wrapper\">\n        <div class=\"footer-text\">\n            Atlanta Chicago Dallas Houston Los Angeles Louisville New York Sacramento San Francisco Silicon Valley Washington<br>\n            Argentina Beijing Brussels Dublin Frankfurt Guangzhou Hong Kong Kuala Lumpur London Madrid Melbourne<br>\n            Mexico City Milan Montreal Paris Shanghai Singapore Sydney Tokyo Toronto\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder footer-logo\">[Logo: bottom-right]</div>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
